api","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_63","text":"What is it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_64","text":"The right path. Why haven't the lights gone out?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_65","text":"If they weren't connected to the main crystal cluster, it should have gone out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_66","text":"Hmm... You're right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_67","text":"This is purely a gut feeling,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_68","text":"but the right path seems... how to put it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_69","text":"artificial.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_70","text":"Artificial?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_71","text":"Yes. Up to this point, the crystals along the path have been growing freely.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_72","text":"This side, on the other hand, seems carefully manicured. Like it was deliberately designed to look a certain way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_73","text":"It's almost too perfectly random. It doesn't produce any feeling of unease.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_74","text":"And the pathway is far too winding.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_75","text":"Looking at it straight on, there are some turns that are so sharp that you can see the walls.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_76","text":"This was a trade city. They would have never designed a road like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_77","text":"Whatever designed these crystal formations, they're intentionally making people get away from the road.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_78","text":"Maybe there's some hidden treasure afoot?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_79","text":"Let's go that way, then!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_80","text":"I'm not sure what it could be, but this is a clear sign something is waiting for us there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_81","text":"Experience has told me that if the signs are telling you something, you should follow them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_e_82","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_e_82","text":"All right, let's move.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}